    "authorAssociation": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "I see the custom surrounding system for `mini.surround` has changed. I have this input surrounding defined using the old system:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\ninput = { find = \"%b[]\", extract = \"^(%[[^%s%[%]]*%s*).*(%])$\" },\r\n```\r\n\r\nHow do I translate it to the new system? The guide in the documentation can't be applied because ane pattern for `find` doesn't contain the pattern for `replace`,",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I see the custom surrounding system for <code class=\"notranslate\">mini.surround</code> has changed. I have this input surrounding defined using the old system:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"input = { find = &quot;%b[]&quot;, extract = &quot;^(%[[^%s%[%]]*%s*).*(%])$&quot; },\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-smi\">input</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">find</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>%b[]<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">extract</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>^(%[[^%s%[%]]*%s*).*(%])$<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>},</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">How do I translate it to the new system? The guide in the documentation can't be applied because ane pattern for <code class=\"notranslate\">find</code> doesn't contain the pattern for <code class=\"notranslate\">replace</code>,</p>",
    "bodyText": "I see the custom surrounding system for mini.surround has changed. I have this input surrounding defined using the old system:\ninput = { find = \"%b[]\", extract = \"^(%[[^%s%[%]]*%s*).*(%])$\" },\nHow do I translate it to the new system? The guide in the documentation can't be applied because ane pattern for find doesn't contain the pattern for replace,",
    "category": {
